# TL2: TIMED arm L of the ABABA sequence (T0s TA1 TL1 TA2 TL2 TA3; A = c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix, the production profile; L = c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-traffic, Lever N + prefix reuse on the traffic profile). Audits off. Tests: warmup, coding, concurrent8_steady,
# concurrent8_code_equal (about 4k), eight 32k users. The ARC runner sets are at ZERO for this block, S and GG (about 170 minutes); no build, no CI push, no other job beside it.
# READ with scripts/ci/w2ln_timing_compare.py: `floor TA1 TA2 TA3 --window <steady|32k>` is the A-to-A drift d_L, `pair TAn TLn --window <steady|32k> --a-load .. --b-load ..` each pair, with the load rule (--max-load from THIS window's own S0b load.log (same host, same day; T0s's if S0b's is missing), never W-1's S0-CTL's
# load.log, --load-gap 2) and 100 matched eight-live rounds a window or the pair is VOID. Lever N's steady cost is INSIDE when both pairs' deltas sit inside d_L at steady AND 32k (the eight-live overlap exists there by
# construction); T0s against TA1 is the offset of the window image against production and must sit inside d_L at both lengths, else every reading is relative to production with that offset.
# TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the W-2 window pack (tp4-w2-levern-jobs: Lever N robustness, then the cutover; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/stage1-windows and push the job's tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Names no rig, card, host or registry. ORDER.txt has the order,
# the classes, the minutes, the boxes, the tags and every rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-11 is the window image (the combined branch's engine with the Lever N traffic profile baked in as its
# default); a job that names tp4-serve-10 runs the production base image. C2_BOX_MINUTES is the job's box: the workflow enforces it from inside, it never cancels a run.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-11
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-traffic
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent8_code_32k
C2_BOX_MINUTES=20
